Cognate with {{m|ja|潮|tr=shio||&#91;[[ocean]]&#93; [[tide]]}}.<ref name="KDJ">{{R:Kokugo Dai Jiten}}</ref><ref name="DJR"/>

The medial consonant had already [[lenite]]d to {{IPAchar|/w/}} by 1603, as recorded in the ''{{w|Nippo Jisho}}''.<ref>{{R:Nippo Jisho original}}, entry visible [https://books.google.com/books?id=TFJAAQAAMAAJ&pg=PP615#v=onepage&q=%22xiun%22&f=false here] as the third entry below the yellow-highlighted term on the left</ref>

